ound image seamlessly.\n  3. Ensure the cards and options (\"Cliente Nuevo\" with mensualidades/formulario, \"Quiero Visita\", \"Acceso Directo\") match what the user had.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Progress\n- **Created Executables**:\n  - Compiled native Windows `.exe` using `csc.exe` (`C:\\Windows\\Microsoft.NET\\Framework64\\v4.0.30319\\csc.exe`) with `icon.ico` and `/target:winexe`.\n  - Placed at:\n    - `c:\\Users\\andre\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\gym\\accesos directos\\CONTROL_DE_ACCESO.exe`\n    - `c:\\Users\\andre\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\gym\\accesos directos\\CONTROL_DE_ACCESO_FITNESS_LEGENDS.exe`\n    - `c:\\Users\\andre\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\gym\\accesos directos\\ACCESO_CLIENTES_LEGENDS.exe`\n    - `c:\\Users\\andre\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\gym\\CONTROL_DE_ACCESO.exe`\n    - `c:\\Users\\andre\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\gym\\ACCESO_CLIENTES_LEGENDS.exe`\n    - Shortcut on Desktop: `C:\\Users\\andre\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\CONTROL DE ACCESO - FITNESS LEGENDS.lnk`\n  - Fixed executable launcher C# logic to search across multi-level directory paths (`baseDir`, `baseDir\\LEGENDS\\release\\...`, `baseDir\\..\\LEGENDS\\release\\...`) and strip `ELECTRON_RUN_AS_NODE` from `EnvironmentVariables`. Verified execution: process `ControlDeAccesoLegends` starts and stays running without error.\n- **Implemented In-App Switch to Cartera de Clientes**:\n  - In `IndependentTerminalApp.tsx`: Added `onOpenClients` prop and top button `[👥 CARTERA DE CLIENTES]`.\n  - In `App.tsx`: Added `isClientsMode()` and `terminalView` state (`'terminal' | 'clients' | 'main'`). If `terminalView === 'clients'`, renders the full `ClientList` with a top bar and `[⚡ VOLVER A TERMINAL DE ACCESO]` button that seamlessly switches back to the Terminal without closing the window.\n  - Verified `tsc -b --noEmit`: 0 errors.\n  - Built with Vite and synced to `release/FITNESS_LEGENDS_TERMINAL-win32-x64/resources/app/dist`.\n- **Investigated Background Image History**:\n  - Found git history in `LEGENDS`:\n    - Commit `1f99c7e`: \"*chore